{
    "title": "Breaking News - Live Headlines",
    "description": "Get the latest daily world news and local news. Breaking News allows you to discover and track trending topics both locally and globally with unique content experience. Articles and coverage from authoritative news media and newspapers provide you with in-depth insights into the daily news and daily review. Grasp the latest global news coverage from the United States, the United Kingdom, Canada, and other countries and regions. Interested in updates on weather conditions and significant events around your neighborhood? Eager to stay attuned to the global trend with no halt in live headlines? Embrace our community and stay informed about local news developments near you.\r\n\r\n<b>Connect to the World</b>\r\nA wide range of topics to choose from. Follow what you want to know like politics, business, health, entertainment, tech, and so on. Breaking news, world news and local news are covered in this news aggregator to boast global understanding. Stay abreast of both local updates and breaking headlines with comprehensive worldwide news coverage from various newspapers and media outlets.\r\n\r\n<b>Local & International News</b>\r\nVetted national and local headlines from trusted and credible news sources like CNN News, Apple News, BBC News, FOX News, Chek News, Google News, and leading newspapers. These renowned media outlets bring you daily commentary and reports on trending news events through their articles. Up-to-date local United States and global news reporting is readily available at your finger. Simply accept the news updates prepared for you by Breaking News to receive information on events happening in your nearby neighborhood, as well as very local news reports. Access global headlines conveniently at any time, anywhere, from any device, allowing you to download to read offline. This way, you won't miss out on the daily news updates just for you.\r\n\r\n<b>Varied News Sources</b>\r\nWe bring you news coverage on all the fields you might be interested in. With the Breaking News app, you can engage with valuable world news content based on your interests and reading preferences. You can always discover articles about topics you're interested in on Breaking News, sourced from top newspapers and media outlets. Simply tap the 'Follow' icon to add sources, streamlining access to the latest & live news that matters most to you. Get live updates from the news sources within the latest hours due to the varied news sources.\r\n\r\n<b>Customized News Feed</b>\r\nGet local news, community updates, and real-time weather alerts from your region's trusted newspapers and media. Keep informed of the local weather alerts for your schedule. Discover your new interests through the numerous news sections on Breaking News. Feel free to follow the news source for your liking. Customize your news feed according to your preferred topics and regions. Intuitive user interface for seamless news exploration.\r\n\r\nDon't just read the news freely - experience it. The breaking news app isn't just about serving news headlines from newspapers, it's about letting you live local or global news!\r\n\r\n<b>Breaking News,</b> your means to gaining insights about the world trend through top newspapers and media sources. Download to get free live news and keep pace with the world's heartbeat!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get the latest daily world news and local news. Breaking News allows you to discover and track trending topics both locally and globally with unique content experience. Articles and coverage from authoritative news media and newspapers provide you with in-depth insights into the daily news and daily review. Grasp the latest global news coverage from the United States, the United Kingdom, Canada, and other countries and regions. Interested in updates on weather conditions and significant events around your neighborhood? Eager to stay attuned to the global trend with no halt in live headlines? Embrace our community and stay informed about local news developments near you.<br><br><b>Connect to the World</b><br>A wide range of topics to choose from. Follow what you want to know like politics, business, health, entertainment, tech, and so on. Breaking news, world news and local news are covered in this news aggregator to boast global understanding. Stay abreast of both local updates and breaking headlines with comprehensive worldwide news coverage from various newspapers and media outlets.<br><br><b>Local &amp; International News</b><br>Vetted national and local headlines from trusted and credible news sources like CNN News, Apple News, BBC News, FOX News, Chek News, Google News, and leading newspapers. These renowned media outlets bring you daily commentary and reports on trending news events through their articles. Up-to-date local United States and global news reporting is readily available at your finger. Simply accept the news updates prepared for you by Breaking News to receive information on events happening in your nearby neighborhood, as well as very local news reports. Access global headlines conveniently at any time, anywhere, from any device, allowing you to download to read offline. This way, you won&#39;t miss out on the daily news updates just for you.<br><br><b>Varied News Sources</b><br>We bring you news coverage on all the fields